# What the host eval needs besides the phone's model files (those come from out/manifest.json).
# One file per line: <path in the cache> <url> <sha256>. Blank lines and # comments are skipped.
# An archive (.tar.gz, .tar.bz2) is unpacked into <path without the extension>/ once its SHA-256 is checked.

# llama.cpp b10256, the build llama.rn 0.12.9 bundles (its cpp/common/build-info.cpp), CPU for x86-64 Linux.
